+    $$ \alpha = \text{GmLUT}[\text{Gradient}] \cdot \text{opacityLUT}[\text{sampleValue}] $$
+    If `Gmom=0`, $\alpha = \text{opacityLUT}[\text{sampleValue}]$ [S3, unofficial].
 
